      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Join key\n\nLab `run_id` is the session id. It is on `ltx_run_info`, worker logs (`run_id=`), and MLflow tag `run_id`.\n\nLoad name is always `ltx-2.5-22b-distilled`. Memory/CPU gauges are process-wide; pin them to a run with the generation time window.\n\n```promql\nltx_run_info{run_id=\"$run_id\"}\nltx_memory_bytes\nltx_cpu_percent\nltx_memory_bytes{type=~\"mps_.+\"}\nhistogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(ltx_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])) by (le, stage))\nltx_ledger_runs\nltx_run_active\n```\n\n```logql\n{job=\"ltx-worker\"} |= `$run_id`\n```"
      },
      "title": "Trace queries",
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "sum(ltx_ledger_runs)", "legendFormat": "ledger", "refId": "A" }],
      "title": "Ledger runs",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "short" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "ltx_run_active", "legendFormat": "active", "refId": "A" }],
      "title": "Worker active",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": { "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] } },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "ltx_last_run_duration_seconds", "legendFormat": "last", "refId": "A" }],
      "title": "Last run duration",
      "type": "stat"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "bytes" }, "overrides": [] },
